  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": [
        "Drumming gets you started, but a camp needs power while you are away. The [Pulse Resonator](pulse_resonator) makes Pulse on its own once you seat a crystal in it and give it company. Craft it from iron, amethyst, two Copper Resonators and a Spirit Shard.",
        "Take the Echo Shard from your Shatter and right-click the Resonator with it. The shard stays inside as its catalyst and is slowly spent by the Pulse it makes: one shard is good for about 20,000 Pulse, roughly forty minutes at the first rate. Keep a spare.",
        "Then place totems of **two different voices** nearby, for example Earth and Fire. Two Earth totems still count as one voice. Keep a Lattice Conductor in reach of the Resonator and the totems: it carries the Resonator's Pulse to your machines and keeps the totems' buffers, and so their voices, full."
      ]
    },
